Revert goauthentik/authentik#26353 (use the leftmost X-Forwarded-For IP).

The leftmost X-Forwarded-For entry is client-controlled: behind a proxy that
appends ($proxy_add_x_forwarded_for in nginx), any client picks the IP
authentik records. Restores rightmost-untrusted from 2026.8.3. Drop once
https://github.com/goauthentik/authentik/issues/26941 is fixed upstream.

